window.SAMPLE_DOC="# Refund rules\n\n## Refund window\n\n- A refund can be requested up to 14 days after delivery. Example: an order delivered on 1 March can be refunded until 15 March.\n\n## Payout\n\n- A refund is paid to the original payment method. Example: an order paid by card is refunded to that card.\n";